--- stdout ---
Static analysis codebase linter

Usage: omni-code-lint [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...
          Paths to inspect
          
          [default: .]

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format for diagnostics

          Possible values:
          - plain: Human-readable text
          - json:  Pretty-printed JSON array
          
          [default: plain]

      --diff
          Run linter only on files/lines changed in VCS

      --diff-rev <DIFF_REV>
          Run linter comparing against a custom revision/commit (implies --diff)

      --list-rules
          List every rule with its languages and summary, as Markdown

      --tag <LABEL>
          With --list-rules, keep only the rules a `select` label selects (tag, synonym or rule)

      --list-tags
          List the topic tree with each topic's parent, synonyms, description and scope note

      --explain <RULE>
          Print one rule's documentation as Markdown

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

